  "ingredients": [
    "2 (4 ounce) salmon fillets",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 tablespoons butter, divided",
    "1 clove garlic",
    "0.5 cup heavy cream",
    "2 teaspoons Meyer lemon juice",
    "0.25 pinch dried dill weed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wBoHBZH_N8ya_Qdhjf4bK7JK79s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-268768-meyer-lemon-cream-sauce-for-salmon-step-01-6260ba9d321048619574216d8c5182bc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268768/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season salmon fillets with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/82S6iPs4xBWMyBcJl385NNDa3vE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-268768-meyer-lemon-cream-sauce-for-salmon-step-02-0de245bc15514f429ba3cd467df63e86.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268768/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 1 tablespoon butter in a skillet over medium-high heat. Cook salmon, skin side-up, in melted butter until golden brown, 5 to 7 minutes. Flip salmon; continue cooking until skin is slightly browned and fish flakes easily with a fork, about 5 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gSOVltcqIQHuYf2aqoVYE9fJnbQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-268768-meyer-lemon-cream-sauce-for-salmon-step-03-b13e4dd0703a475ea6f68f3db3cc747c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268768/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt remaining 1 tablespoon butter in a saucepan. Press garlic into butter using a garlic press and cook for 1 minute. Pour in cream and stir constantly for 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ri3b-gMxdlkwIHjU0vzjAM4o2FE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-268768-meyer-lemon-cream-sauce-for-salmon-step-04-f3471aa0876941da81d91d333087e373.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268768/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add lemon juice and dill. Be careful that sauce doesn't break.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gBMIRBhkjEk89vnivyoXVSxWYZM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-268768-meyer-lemon-cream-sauce-for-salmon-step-05-2fa5e03c869c4d8180f8d20ee3d2c7db.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268768/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve lemon sauce over salmon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
